= SMW Query Patterns Reference: Machine-Readable Knowledge Retrieval =

== Executive Summary

This reference documents Semantic MediaWiki query patterns optimized for BITwiki's recursive knowledge architecture. All queries support epistemic filtering, confidence thresholds, and knowledge graph traversal.

'''Prerequisite:''' Understanding of SMW properties defined in BITwiki_Property_Dictionary.

----
== 1. Basic Query Patterns

=== 1.1 Entity Type Queries

'''List all Concepts:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::Concept]]
|?Has title
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|format=table
|limit=50
}}
```

'''List all Projects with confidence > 0.8:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::Project]] [[Has confidence::>0.8]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|?Has domain
|format=table
|sort=Has confidence
|order=desc
}}
```

'''List all Established entities:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::Established]]
|?Has title
|?Has entity type
|?Has confidence
|format=ul
}}
```

=== 1.2 Domain-Based Queries

'''All entities in Systems Science:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has domain::Systems science]]
|?Has title
|?Has entity type
|?Has epistemic status
|format=table
}}
```

'''Cross-domain entities (multiple domains):'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has domain::Systems science]] [[Has domain::Cybernetics]]
|?Has title
|?Has domain
|format=table
}}
```

=== 1.3 Temporal Queries

'''Recently created entities:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has creation date::>2026-01-01]]
|?Has title
|?Has creation date
|?Has author
|format=table
|sort=Has creation date
|order=desc
}}
```

'''Entities modified in last 30 days:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has modification date::>2026-01-13]]
|?Has title
|?Has modification date
|format=table
}}
```

----
== 2. Epistemic Filtering Queries

=== 2.1 Confidence Thresholds

'''High-confidence claims (>0.9):'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence::>0.9]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|?Has epistemic status
|format=table
|sort=Has confidence
|order=desc
}}
```

'''Hypothetical claims (<0.5):'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence::<0.5]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|?Has epistemic status
|format=table
}}
```

'''Confidence range (0.7-0.9):'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence::>0.7]] [[Has confidence::<0.9]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|format=table
}}
```

=== 2.2 Status-Based Filtering

'''All Axiomatic statements:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::Axiomatic]]
|?Has title
|?Has entity type
|format=ul
}}
```

'''Emerging or Contested claims:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::Emerging]] OR [[Has epistemic status::Contested]]
|?Has title
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|format=table
}}
```

'''Established or Axiomatic (high confidence):'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::Established]] OR [[Has epistemic status::Axiomatic]]
|?Has title
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|format=table
|sort=Has confidence
|order=desc
}}
```

=== 2.3 Provenance Queries

'''Entities by specific author:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has author::Hyperion]]
|?Has title
|?Has creation date
|?Has entity type
|format=table
}}
```

'''Entities with verified provenance:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has provenance type::Verified]]
|?Has title
|?Has provenance type
|?Has verification method
|format=table
}}
```

----
== 3. Relationship Queries

=== 3.1 Direct Relationships

'''Entities related to BITwiki_Constitution:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity::BITwiki_Constitution]]
|?Has title
|?Has relationship type
|format=table
}}
```

'''Concepts that implement other concepts:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has relationship type::Implements]]
|?Has title
|?Has related entity
|format=table
}}
```

'''Entities with bidirectional relationships:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity::+]]
|?Has title
|?Has related entity
|?Has relationship type
|format=table
}}
```

=== 3.2 Hierarchical Queries

'''Sub-concepts of Systems Science:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has parent concept::Systems science]]
|?Has title
|?Has parent concept
|format=ul
}}
```

'''All descendants (recursive):'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has parent concept::Systems science]] OR [[Has parent concept.Subconcept::Systems science]]
|?Has title
|?Has parent concept
|format=ul
}}
```

=== 3.3 Network Traversal

'''Two-hop relationships:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity.Has related entity::BITwiki_Constitution]]
|?Has title
|format=ul
}}
```

'''Common neighbors:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity::Concept_A]] [[Has related entity::Concept_B]]
|?Has title
|format=ul
}}
```

----
== 4. Aggregation Queries

=== 4.1 Counting

'''Total entities by type:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|?Has entity type
|format=count
}}
```

'''Count by epistemic status:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::+]]
|?Has epistemic status
|format=count
}}
```

=== 4.2 Statistical Aggregations

'''Average confidence by entity type:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|?Has confidence
|format=average
}}
```

'''Maximum confidence:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence::+]]
|?Has confidence
|format=max
}}
```

'''Confidence distribution:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence::+]]
|?Has confidence
|format=median
}}
```

=== 4.3 Grouped Aggregations

'''Entities grouped by domain:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has domain::+]]
|?Has domain
|?Has title
|format=ul
|group=Has domain
}}
```

'''Average confidence by status:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::+]]
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|format=average
|group=Has epistemic status
}}
```

----
== 5. Advanced Patterns

=== 5.1 Subqueries

'''Entities with high-confidence related entities:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity::<q>[[Has confidence::>0.9]]</q>]]
|?Has title
|?Has related entity
|format=table
}}
```

'''Concepts related to Established projects:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity::<q>[[Has entity type::Project]] [[Has epistemic status::Established]]</q>]]
|?Has title
|format=ul
}}
```

=== 5.2 Concept Definitions

'''Define "High-Confidence Concepts":'''
```mediawiki
{{#concept: High-Confidence Concepts
|[[Has entity type::Concept]] [[Has confidence::>0.8]]
}}
```

'''Use concept in query:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Concept:High-Confidence Concepts]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|format=table
}}
```

=== 5.3 Template-Based Display

'''Use template for custom formatting:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::Concept]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|format=template
|template=Concept_List_Item
}}
```

'''Template:Concept_List_Item:'''
```mediawiki
<li>
  <strong>{{{1}}}</strong>
  <span class="confidence">(confidence: {{{2}}})</span>
</li>
```

