== 6. Epistemic Audit Queries

=== 6.1 Quality Assessment

'''Entities missing epistemic markers:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::+]]
|?Has title
|?Has epistemic status
|format=table
}}
```

'''Entities with outdated confidence:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence evaluation date::<2026-01-01]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|?Has confidence evaluation date
|format=table
}}
```

'''Entities requiring review:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::Hypothetical]] [[Has confidence::>0.7]]
|?Has title
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|format=table
}}
```

=== 6.2 Provenance Audit

'''Entities with unverified sources:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has provenance type::Unverified]]
|?Has title
|?Has provenance type
|format=table
}}
```

'''Entities missing sources:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has source count::0]]
|?Has title
|format=ul
}}
```

----
== 7. Performance Optimization

=== 7.1 Query Limits

'''Always use limits for large result sets:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|limit=100
|format=table
}}
```

'''Pagination:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|limit=50
|offset=50
|format=table
}}
```

=== 7.2 Sorting

'''Sort by confidence descending:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has confidence::+]]
|?Has confidence
|sort=Has confidence
|order=desc
|format=table
}}
```

'''Multiple sort keys:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|?Has epistemic status
|?Has confidence
|sort=Has epistemic status,Has confidence
|order=asc,desc
|format=table
}}
```

=== 7.3 Caching

'''Cache expensive queries:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|?Has confidence
|format=average
|cache=3600
}}
```

----
== 8. Query Templates

=== 8.1 Reusable Query Templates

'''Template:RelatedEntities:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has related entity::{{FULLPAGENAME}}]]
|?Has title
|?Has relationship type
|?Has epistemic status
|format=table
|limit={{{limit|10}}}
|intro=<h3>Related Entities</h3>
|default=No related entities found.
}}
```

'''Template:DomainIndex:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has domain::{{{1|}}}]]
|?Has title
|?Has entity type
|?Has confidence
|format=table
|limit={{{limit|50}}}
|sort=Has confidence
|order=desc
|intro=<h3>Entities in {{{1|}}}</h3>
}}
```

=== 8.2 Parameterized Queries

'''Template:EpistemicFilter:'''
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has epistemic status::{{{status|Established}}}]] [[Has confidence::>{{{min_confidence|0.8}}}]]
|?Has title
|?Has confidence
|format=table
|limit={{{limit|20}}}
}}
```

'''Usage:'''
```mediawiki
{{EpistemicFilter|status=Emerging|min_confidence=0.6|limit=10}}
```

----
== 9. Common Query Patterns Summary

| Pattern | Query | Use Case |
|---------|-------|----------|
| '''Type Filter''' | `[[Has entity type::Concept]]` | Entity classification |
| '''Status Filter''' | `[[Has epistemic status::Established]]` | Quality filtering |
| '''Confidence Threshold''' | `[[Has confidence::>0.8]]` | Reliability filtering |
| '''Domain Filter''' | `[[Has domain::Systems science]]` | Subject filtering |
| '''Temporal Filter''' | `[[Has creation date::>2026-01-01]]` | Recent content |
| '''Relationship''' | `[[Has related entity::PageName]]` | Graph traversal |
| '''Aggregation''' | `format=count` / `format=average` | Statistics |
| '''Subquery''' | `<q>[[Has confidence::>0.9]]</q>` | Nested filtering |

----
== 10. Troubleshooting

=== 10.1 Common Issues

'''No results:'''
* Check property names (case-sensitive)
* Verify property has [[Has type::...]] declaration
* Check for extra spaces in values

'''Slow queries:'''
* Add `|limit=` parameter
* Use `|cache=` for repeated queries
* Simplify subqueries

'''Incorrect sorting:'''
* Ensure property has appropriate type
* Use `|order=asc` or `|order=desc`
* Check for mixed data types

=== 10.2 Debug Mode

Enable query debugging:
```mediawiki
{{#ask: [[Has entity type::+]]
|?Has title
|format=debug
}}
```

